{
  "short_id": "short267",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-064-memphis",
  "voice_stage": "draft",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.314,
  "total_seconds": 58.01,
  "master": "H:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-064-memphis\\06_voice\\draft\\short267\\en_us\\short267_vc_draft_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "The utility terminated service for about two thousand customers each month. That number appears in the dissent's description of how the existing system worked.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 8.406,
      "seconds": 8.406,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:2b2d23d3696162c15cedae39f74121bb9fcf34c2d9a3069eb203edee6fad29dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Its notices printed an information-center phone number answered by thirty or forty employees who could delay cutoffs for three days.",
      "start": 8.626,
      "end": 16.01,
      "seconds": 7.384,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:aa64ead5273dfe06b64167808bfcfedd092bf514ee56a57528de42816afdc269"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Those employees could also refer callers to credit counselors with broader authority to resolve disputes and arrange extended payment plans.",
      "start": 16.23,
      "end": 23.521,
      "seconds": 7.291,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6ba5e8aa85b813feb23dcb533730d7aceb6b572f436cf5fba80f8f86db280207"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The dissent believed that machinery was enough and accused the majority of confusing and trivializing the constitutional principle at stake.",
      "start": 23.741,
      "end": 31.404,
      "seconds": 7.663,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:578d6d014b7f325f4b0bbe9ccb9fe2c30800064d407a2b2c7ce9375394a9368e"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The majority disagreed because the notice itself did not clearly tell customers how and where to obtain a meaningful hearing.",
      "start": 31.624,
      "end": 38.033,
      "seconds": 6.409,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:44fd0ef7771503ed78c146ddd9ffbe645ba95b286e5b3ab5a2595f0b553920a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "But winning a right to notice and a hearing did not erase the utility's power to terminate service.",
      "start": 38.253,
      "end": 43.269,
      "seconds": 5.016,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:3f34f35fc74879e9d4d62e10786c828e8ee31e7e7960e72e708ed0c85ab934ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "After providing that opportunity and deciding the amount was justly due, the utility still retained the option to cut service.",
      "start": 43.489,
      "end": 50.501,
      "seconds": 7.012,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:54e686c51b5e3766e0b37fc34d9e4123ed74a1e4976fcb9c82211bbb46983fbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "So the case added procedure before shutoff, not immunity from shutoff, returning to the monthly system that began this dispute.",
      "start": 50.721,
      "end": 58.012,
      "seconds": 7.291,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:01e0ccdd1d0a61fccf82f691d245218ab6a81b2a1db3127328b6daec5e0f8b04"
    }
  ]
}
